BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-09-16-run-1800@marathon2027
DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20260916T180000
DTEND:20260916T190000
SUMMARY:🏃 Fartlek 6 × 1' / 2'
DESCRIPTION:Week B4\n\n2 km easy\, then 6 × 1 minute quick (about 10k pa
 ce\, not a sprint) with 2 minutes easy jog between\, then easy to 7 km. 
 Hard-ish\, not hard. Paces: easy 5:35–6:00 (HR <145) · MP 5:12–5:20
  · T 4:40–4:48 · 10k 4:22–4:28 · I 4:05–4:12 (800 ≈ 3:20\, 1k
  ≈ 4:08). Re-set after the 5k TT (17 Oct) and the January half.
CATEGORIES:run
END:VEVENT
