DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20260922T064500
DTEND:20260922T074500
SUMMARY:🚴 Bike — hard session
DESCRIPTION:Week B5\n\nYour own session — Z4/Z5\, as now.\n\n45–60 mi
 nutes. This is one of the week's three hard days (bike Tue\, run Wed\, l
 ong run Sat).
CATEGORIES:bike
END:VEVENT
