UID:2026-09-24-bike-0645@marathon2027
DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20260924T064500
DTEND:20260924T073500
SUMMARY:🚴 Bike — hard session (base: your own)
DESCRIPTION:Week B5\n\nYour own session — Z4/Z5\, as now.\n\nBase phase
 : this can stay hard — run quality is only strides until October\, so 
 nothing clashes. From 19 Oct it becomes Z2.
CATEGORIES:bike
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-09-23-bike-1800@marathon2027
DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20260923T180000
DTEND:20260923T190000
SUMMARY:🚴 Bike — 60' Z2 (optional)
DESCRIPTION:Week B5\n\nOptional. 60 minutes Z2 at most — under 145 bpm.
  The old 70 km Wednesday evening ride is gone for the duration\; if you 
 ride\, it's a spin. Not at all in the block.
CATEGORIES:bike
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-09-27-bike-0930@marathon2027
DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20260927T093000
DTEND:20260927T133000
SUMMARY:🚴 Long ride — Z2\, max 4 h
DESCRIPTION:Week B5\n\nThe one long ride of the week. Z2: heart rate unde
 r 145\, under 240 W. Cap 4 h — that's a ceiling\, not a target. Yester
 day was the long run\, so this is a flush\; if the group ride turns into
  a hammerfest\, drop off. No back-to-back 100 km days in the block.
CATEGORIES:bike
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-09-21-gym-1230@marathon2027
DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20260921T123000
DTEND:20260921T133000
SUMMARY:🏋️ Chest & triceps + Core A
DESCRIPTION:Week B5\n\nBench or DB press 3×6–8\nIncline DB press 3×8
 –10\nDips or push-ups 3×8–10\nTriceps pushdown / overhead extension
  3×10\n\nCore A (15'): dead bug 3×8/side · Pallof press 3×10/side ·
  front plank 3×45 s · hanging knee raise 3×10.\n\nKeep it to 45–60 
 min so Monday stays a recovery day for the legs.
CATEGORIES:gym
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-09-23-gym-1230@marathon2027
DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20260923T123000
DTEND:20260923T133000
SUMMARY:🏋️ Back & biceps + Core B
DESCRIPTION:Week B5\n\nRows 3×6–8\nPull-ups or lat pulldown 3×6–10\
 nFace pulls 3×12 — posture late in the marathon\nCurls 3×10\n\nCore 
 B (15'): side plank 3×30 s/side · bird dog 3×8/side · suitcase carry
  3×30 m/side.\n\nLunchtime or morning — not right before the evening 
 quality run.
CATEGORIES:gym
END:VEVENT
