DTSTART:20260930T180000
DTEND:20260930T190000
SUMMARY:🏃 Fartlek 6 × 2' / 2'
DESCRIPTION:Week B6\n\n2 km easy\, then 6 × 2 minutes at about 10k effor
 t with 2 minutes easy between\, then easy to 8 km. Paces: easy 5:35–6:
 00 (HR <145) · MP 5:12–5:20 · T 4:40–4:48 · 10k 4:22–4:28 · I 
 4:05–4:12 (800 ≈ 3:20\, 1k ≈ 4:08). Re-set after the 5k TT (17 Oct
 ) and the January half.
