SUMMARY:🏃 Easy run 15 km
DESCRIPTION:Week B6\n\n15 km at easy pace\, 5:35–6:00/km\, heart rate u
 nder 145. Conversational the whole way — the cyclist's engine will wan
 t to go faster\; the legs don't get a vote yet\, so don't let it. Take g
 els from now on every long run: one at 40 minutes\, one at 75. Practisin
 g the gut is a training target like any other.
CATEGORIES:run
END:VEVENT
