 . Paces: easy 5:35–6:00 (HR <145) · MP 5:12–5:20 · T 4:40–4:48 
 · 10k 4:22–4:28 · I 4:05–4:12 (800 ≈ 3:20\, 1k ≈ 4:08). Re-set
