 ity (10'): couch stretch 2×60 s/side · 90/90 hip switches 2×8 · ankl
 e dorsiflexion wall touches 2×10/side · thoracic rotations 2×8/side\n
 2. Strength-light (12'): banded lateral walks 3×12/side · single-leg g
 lute bridge 3×10/side · Copenhagen plank 3×20 s/side\n3. Nordic curls
  2×4 — the best eccentric hamstring work there is. Sore for the first
  few weeks\; that's why they start now\, not in December.\n4. Step-downs
  off a box 2×10/side\, slow · single-leg balance\n5. Dead bug or Pallo
 f if time
