SUMMARY:🏃 Easy run 8 km + strides
DESCRIPTION:Week W7\n\n8 km at easy pace\, 5:35–6:00/km\, heart rate un
 der 145. Conversational the whole way — the cyclist's engine will want
  to go faster\; the legs don't get a vote yet\, so don't let it. Finish 
 with 6 × 20–25 s strides\, building to about mile pace\, relaxed\, fu
 ll walk-back between. They keep leg speed while everything else is slow.
  
CATEGORIES:run
