DTSTART:20261202T180000
DTEND:20261202T191500
SUMMARY:🏃 Threshold 4 × 2 km
DESCRIPTION:Week W7\n\nWarm up 3 km easy + 4 strides. 4 × 2 km at thresh
 old with 90 s jog. Cool down 2 km easy. Paces: easy 5:35–6:00 (HR <145
 ) · MP 5:12–5:20 · T 4:40–4:48 · 10k 4:22–4:28 · I 4:05–4:12
  (800 ≈ 3:20\, 1k ≈ 4:08). Re-set after the 5k TT (17 Oct) and the J
 anuary half.
CATEGORIES:run
END:VEVENT
