DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20261205T090000
DTEND:20261205T114600
SUMMARY:🏃 Long run 26 km
DESCRIPTION:Week W7\n\nAll at easy pace\, 5:35–6:00/km\, HR under 145. 
 Walk breaks are fine. Gel at 40' and every 30–35' after. Two blocks of
  4 km at marathon pace (5:12–5:20/km) — the first starting at 10 km\
 , the second at 18 km — with 1 km easy 'float' between. First proper M
 P blocks. Paces: easy 5:35–6:00 (HR <145) · MP 5:12–5:20 · T 4:40
 –4:48 · 10k 4:22–4:28 · I 4:05–4:12 (800 ≈ 3:20\, 1k ≈ 4:08)
 . Re-set after the 5k TT (17 Oct) and the January half.
