BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-12-13-race-0830@marathon2027
DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20261213T083000
DTEND:20261213T140000
SUMMARY:🏁 70.3 — swim 1.9 km / bike 90 km / run 21.1 km
DESCRIPTION:Week W8\n\nSelf-supported half-iron day. Start about 08:30.\n
 \nSWIM 1.9 km — 40–50 min. 76 lengths of a 25 m pool\, steady\, bila
 teral breathing. T1 about 5 min.\n\nBIKE 90 km — 2:45–3:15 on the tr
 ainer. Z2 to low tempo: 200–240 W\, no more. Not a Zwift race. 70–90
  g carbs/hour (your bottle mix). T2 about 5 min: shoes\, gel\, go.\n\nRU
 N 21.1 km — 1:52–2:00 (5:20–5:40/km). First 5 km easy no matter ho
 w good it feels\, then settle toward MP if it's there. 60 g carbs/hour. 
 Not a half PB attempt — the run off the bike is the point.\n\nMonday f
 ully off.
CATEGORIES:race
END:VEVENT
