BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2027-01-17-race-0900@marathon2027
DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20270117T090000
DTEND:20270117T110000
SUMMARY:🏁 Half-marathon race (tune-up)
DESCRIPTION:Week W13\n\n3 km warm-up + strides\, then race the half hones
 tly. Target 1:42–1:46 if fitness is on track (4:50–5:00/km)\; a loca
 l Dutch half or a solo effort on your marathon loop both work. Even pace
 \, no heroics in the first 5 km.\n\nAfterwards: this result plus the W15
  session decide the A/B goal.\n\nHalf time → marathon goal: 1:42 → A
  (3:40) is on\; 1:46 → B (3:45)\; slower → C (3:55) and we talk.
CATEGORIES:race
END:VEVENT
