DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20270119T064500
DTEND:20270119T074500
SUMMARY:🚴 Bike — hard session
DESCRIPTION:Week W14\n\nYour own session\, but cap it at Z4: threshold / 
 sweet-spot intervals\, no all-out Z5\, no races. This is the specific ph
 ase\; the run needs the recovery.\n\n45–60 minutes. This is one of the
  week's three hard days (bike Tue\, run Wed\, long run Sat).
CATEGORIES:bike
