DTEND:20270130T121000
SUMMARY:🏃 Long run 30 km
DESCRIPTION:Week W15\n\nAll at easy pace\, 5:35–6:00/km\, HR under 145.
  Walk breaks are fine. Gel at 40' and every 30–35' after. The key sess
 ion. 8 km easy\, then 16 km continuous at marathon pace (5:12–5:20/km)
 \, then easy to 30 km. Fuel exactly as on race day. If the 16 km felt co
 ntrolled → A goal. If you were hanging on from 12 km → B goal. Paces
 : easy 5:35–6:00 (HR <145) · MP 5:12–5:20 · T 4:40–4:48 · 10k 4
 :22–4:28 · I 4:05–4:12 (800 ≈ 3:20\, 1k ≈ 4:08). Re-set after t
 he 5k TT (17 Oct) and the January half.
