SUMMARY:🏃 Race-pace touch 3 × 1.5 km
DESCRIPTION:Week W18\n\n2 km easy\, 3 × 1.5 km at marathon pace (5:12–
 5:20) with 90 s jog\, 1 km easy. Purely to feel the pace. Paces: easy 5:
 35–6:00 (HR <145) · MP 5:12–5:20 · T 4:40–4:48 · 10k 4:22–4:2
 8 · I 4:05–4:12 (800 ≈ 3:20\, 1k ≈ 4:08). Re-set after the 5k TT 
