BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2027-02-21-race-0900@marathon2027
DTSTAMP:20260827T070309Z
DTSTART:20270221T090000
DTEND:20270221T130000
SUMMARY:🏁 MARATHON
DESCRIPTION:Week W18\n\nRace day.\n\nSeville: 08:30 gun\, breakfast 05:30
 –06:00\, gel 15 min before the start. Self-supported: start 09:30–10
 :00\, 4 laps of the Bos loop\, bag at the lap point.\n\nPACING: 5:12–5
 :20/km through 30 km depending on the goal you locked in W15. No faster 
 in the first 10 km\, whatever it feels like. Even splits. First-timers w
 ho go out 10 s/km fast lose 5+ minutes in the last 10 km.\n\nFUEL: gel a
 t 40 min then every 30 min\, 60 g carbs/hour\, water at every station.\n
 \nGoals: A 3:40 (5:12) · B 3:45 (5:19) · C 3:55 (5:34).
CATEGORIES:race
END:VEVENT
